<h2>What InEgypt does and does not do here</h2>
<p>InEgypt does not sell tickets. It shows these ranges in the app next to the place or route you are looking at, with the common tricks for that kind of place, and it keeps the dates visible so you can tell how fresh a number is.</p>

<h2>Sources</h2>
<p class="sources">Each row names its source and the month it was checked. Official prices link to the operator or the ministry; everything else is an InEgypt estimate from editorial checks. Prices change: if a number looks out of date, write to <a href="mailto:{{ facts.site.contactEmail.value }}">{{ facts.site.contactEmail.value }}</a>.</p>

